right when it came out of my mouth.

22:14.421 --> 22:16.046
-You...
-I'm really sorry.

22:16.130 --> 22:17.963
You are not just going to apologize to me.

22:18.046 --> 22:19.838
You're going to apologize to Joel.

22:19.921 --> 22:21.671
