22:56.005 --> 22:58.171
I'm just fucking with you.
(laughing)

22:58.255 --> 23:00.880
Yeah, come on in.

23:02.505 --> 23:05.171
So, uh, come on in.

23:05.255 --> 23:06.505
Get you a drink?

23:06.588 --> 23:08.213
Vodka soda?

23:08.296 --> 23:09.588
-Uh, yeah.
-Make yourself at home.

23:09.671 --> 23:11.463
Have a seat.

23:11.546 --> 23:12.880
Thanks.

23:17.755 --> 23:19.380
Who's that?

23:19.463 --> 23:21.546
That is Joel Dash.

23:21.630 --> 23:22.838
He's a friend of your mom's.

23:22.921 --> 23:24.546
Kind of like Martin McRae.

23:25.963 --> 23:27.588
Remember him?

23:31.671 --> 23:34.588
