28:00.005 --> 28:02.130
♪ They've been knockin' me out lately ♪

28:02.213 --> 28:03.588
MELINDA:
Come here.

28:03.671 --> 28:06.088
♪ Whenever you come around me ♪

28:07.921 --> 28:11.630
♪ These feelings won't go away ♪

28:11.713 --> 28:16.005
♪ They've been knockin' me sideways ♪

28:16.088 --> 28:20.796
♪ I keep thinking in a moment that ♪

28:20.880 --> 28:23.171
