31:08.046 --> 31:09.588
Uh, it… I think it's interesting.

31:09.671 --> 31:12.921
It's got a fresh tone.

31:13.005 --> 31:14.755
So, uh, what do you do?

31:14.838 --> 31:16.463
Uh, not much.

31:16.546 --> 31:17.755
