-Oh.

32:25.171 --> 32:27.463
You killed Martin McRae.

32:27.546 --> 32:29.963
-KRISTIN: Oh, my God. It's a joke.
-JONAS: Oh, come on.

32:30.046 --> 32:31.463
It was a joke.

32:31.546 --> 32:33.088
JONAS:
Really?

32:33.171 --> 32:35.046
