34:19.255 --> 34:22.421
That wasn't the first thing
that crossed my mind, no.

34:24.463 --> 34:26.838
But it did cross your mind.

34:29.463 --> 34:31.796
I mean...

34:31.880 --> 34:34.005
like, yes, at a certain point, you think,

34:34.088 --> 34:38.130
well, I guess I could, you know,
fuck this person.

34:40.005 --> 34:41.755
