35:12.880 --> 35:14.796
Ow! What was that for?

35:14.880 --> 35:16.338
'Cause the answer was yes.

35:16.421 --> 35:17.588
No, it wasn't.

35:20.213 --> 35:22.046
Ow! Fuck, Melinda.

35:22.130 --> 35:23.671
